# Vendored upstream test corpus (this repo is a fork of KuzuDB).
#
# These are not malformed JSON documents that someone should fix - they are
# fixtures whose whole purpose is to be read by something other than a strict
# JSON parser, and for several of them being invalid as a single JSON document
# IS the thing under test. Editing them would break the tests and be reverted
# by the next upstream merge.
#
# Delta Lake transaction logs are newline-delimited JSON BY SPECIFICATION:
extension/delta/test/delta_tables/
extension/unity_catalog/test/setup/tables/
# Iceberg metadata fixtures that are gzipped, despite the .json extension:
**/*.gz.metadata.json
# Datasets that exist to exercise the JSON/NDJSON readers, including one
# literally named newline-delimited.json:
dataset/json-misc/
# Fixtures that are deliberately malformed, to test the reader's ERROR paths.
# The directory is named json-error; invalidity is the point of every file in
# it, so a JSON validator flagging them is the validator missing the joke:
dataset/json-error/
dataset/doc-examples-json/
dataset/tinysnb_json/
